profile: tinyrustlm-mirust.context.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T20:20:00Z

current_context:
  - TinyRustLM.MiRust.com is the current developer portal for the one prelaunch TinyRustLM.com product.
  - The sole model contract is the exact six-member SLM2 composition.
  - The default package transaction is TinyRustLM.Abstractions, TinyRustLM.Core, and TinyRustLM.P2P.
  - TinyRustLM.MemoryEndpoints is separately optional and serves only the two authorized MemoryEndpoints.com uses.
  - Historical .slm, adapter, selector, q4/q8, and prior runtime materials remain labeled evidence only and have no current compatibility authority.

memory_context: Read totem.uai and taboo.uai; duplicate prelaunch memory is allowed only while all maintained copies stay current and noncontradictory.
campaign_truth: 0/20; 0/50; 0/25; 0/40; 0/20 until exact receipts exist.
